intent: Bring the 7.10.0 distribution docs up to the final nool code release: CHANGELOG gains the sandbox/tools/UX section and the licensing and installer fixes written for users; README, Skills.md, skills/nool-commands SKILL.md and Commands.md, and CLAUDE.md document the [sandbox] keys in ~/.nool/code.toml with an example, /changes (Ctrl+G) and slash autocomplete, plain nool shell commands running as the session agent with landing commands always asking, and list hiding dot entries unless hidden: true. Why: these shipped in 7.10.0 after the docs were cut, and users need the sandbox settings to unblock their toolchains. Checked nool code --help on the installed 7.10.0 binary.
